  npcName: Khepri
  npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueBubbles:
  - snippets:
    - My name was Khepri.
    - I came from Memphis.
  - snippets:
    - I spent most of my life traveling from city to city.
    - I was a merchant of fabrics and jewelry.
  - snippets:
    - A good sale was never only about the product.
    - I always tried to understand what people wanted to hear.
  - snippets:
    - Sometimes I told customers an item was rare, even when I had many more.
    - People liked to believe they had gotten a special deal.
